&lt;p>Lua is &lt;a href="https://www.lua.org/license.html">free software&lt;/a> distributed in &lt;a href="https://www.lua.org/ftp/">source code&lt;/a>. It may be used for any purpose, including commercial purposes, at absolutely no cost.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	Lua 是以&lt;a href="https://www.lua.org/ftp/">源代码&lt;/a>形式分发的&lt;a href="https://www.lua.org/license.html">免费软件&lt;/a>。它可以用于任何目的，包括商业目的，绝对免费。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>All &lt;a href="https://www.lua.org/versions.html">versions&lt;/a> are available for &lt;a href="https://www.lua.org/ftp/">download&lt;/a>. The current version is &lt;a href="https://www.lua.org/versions.html#5.4">Lua 5.4&lt;/a> and its current release is &lt;a href="https://www.lua.org/ftp/lua-5.4.6.tar.gz">Lua 5.4.6&lt;/a>.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	所有&lt;a href="https://www.lua.org/versions.html">版本&lt;/a>均可&lt;a href="https://www.lua.org/ftp/">下载&lt;/a>。当前版本是 &lt;a href="https://www.lua.org/versions.html#5.4">Lua 5.4&lt;/a>，其当前版本是 Lua 5.4.6。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>社区</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/thirdPkg/lua/community/</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 Jan 2024 21:49:44 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/thirdPkg/lua/community/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote>
